msgstr "Leggt fast, wat perioodsch Nakieken anmaakt is."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (IntervalCheckTime), group (cache)
#: gmailresource.kcfg:50
msgid "Check interval in minutes"
msgstr "Nakiek-Afstand in Minuten"

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (RetrieveMetadataOnFolderListing), group (cache)
#: gmailresource.kcfg:55
msgid ""
"Defines if the annotations, ACLs and quota information of mailboxes should\n"
"             also be retrieved when the mailboxes get listed."
msgstr ""
"Fastleggen, wat ok Anmarken, TKLs un Informatschonen över Nettpost-"
"Bruukgrenzdaten\n"
"             bi't Oplisten haalt un wiest warrt."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (AutomaticExpungeEnabled), group (cache)
#: gmailresource.kcfg:60
msgid ""
"Defines if the expunge command is issued automatically, otherwise it should "
"be\n"
"             triggered manually through the D-Bus interface."
msgstr ""
"Fastleggen, wat de Befehl för't Wegmaken automaatsch utgeven warrt, oder vun "
"Hand\n"
"             över de D-BUS-Koppelsteed utlööst warrt."

